WEBVTT

00:17:28.121 --> 00:17:31.871
I didn't even realize that's how I was
feeling about work until I read it.

00:17:31.871 --> 00:17:35.454
Now, I would describe this moment in my

00:17:35.454 --> 00:17:37.996
career as fragmented

00:17:38.246 --> 00:17:46.704
and detached, and I wish I could fix that.

00:17:49.038 --> 00:17:54.329
Trying to fix it will come soon, really
soon. But we're not there yet. For now.

00:17:54.538 --> 00:17:58.704
Fill in the blanks again. Go with the
first ideas that pop in your mind.

00:17:58.829 --> 00:18:02.538
Don't overthink it and do not judge
yourself, for heaven's sake.